        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 213,
        "headingId": 373,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>None</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-25T15:45:11"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 461,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Subtype(s)",
    "headingPosition": 5,
    "headingid": 374,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63457,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 213,
        "headingId": 374,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>None</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-25T15:45:11"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 462,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Localization",
    "headingPosition": 6,
    "headingid": 375,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63458,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 213,
        "headingId": 375,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Uterine ligaments</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-25T15:45:11"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 463,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Clinical features",
    "headingPosition": 7,
    "headingid": 376,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63459,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 213,
        "headingId": 376,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>The tumour occurs in adults and may present with abdominal pain; some cases are incidental findings {22296276}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-25T15:45:11"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 464,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Epidemiology",
    "headingPosition": 8,
    "headingid": 377,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63460,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 213,
        "headingId": 377,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Most patients have VHL {22296276; 22317868; 3341511; 2386149}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-25T15:45:11"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 465,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Etiology",
    "headingPosition": 9,
    "headingid": 378,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63461,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 213,
        "headingId": 378,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>The anatomical location and immunophenotype suggest a mesonephric origin {22296276}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-25T15:45:11"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 466,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Pathogenesis",
    "headingPosition": 10,
    "headingid": 379,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63462,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 213,
        "headingId": 379,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Allelic loss of <em>VHL</em> has been reported {11493991}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-25T15:45:11"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 473,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Macroscopic appearance",
    "headingPosition": 11,
    "headingid": 386,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63463,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 213,
        "headingId": 386,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>The tumours are about 5&nbsp;cm (range: &lt;&nbsp;1 to 8&nbsp;cm), have a thick fibrotic capsule, and are traversed by fibrous bands creating a cystic-solid lobulated appearance {22296276; 9421096}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-25T15:45:11"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 467,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Histopathology",
    "headingPosition": 12,
    "headingid": 380,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63464,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 213,
        "headingId": 380,
        "headingText": "<p>There is complex tubulopapillary growth with varying broad-based and delicate branching and stromal hyalinization. Focal tubular or solid growth may be present. The cells are non-ciliated and cuboidal&nbsp;or low columnar, with minimal clear to eosinophilic cytoplasm. Prominent subepithelial blood vessels are common. The cells are positive for CK7, PAX8, PAX2, and CD10. WT1 and calretinin are variably positive; ER and PR are negative {22296276; 24441657; 22317868; 15767808}.</p>",
        "timestamp": "2020-07-21T12:14:06"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 468,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Cytology",
    "headingPosition": 13,
    "headingid": 381,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63465,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 213,
        "headingId": 381,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Not clinically relevant</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-25T15:45:11"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 469,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Diagnostic molecular pathology",
    "headingPosition": 14,
    "headingid": 382,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63466,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 213,
        "headingId": 382,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Demonstration of germline <em>VHL</em> mutation may be helpful.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-25T15:45:11"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 472,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Essential and desirable diagnostic criteria",
    "headingPosition": 15,
    "headingid": 385,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63467,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 213,
        "headingId": 385,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p><em>Essential:</em> a cystic/lobulated mass; complex tubulopapillary growth of non-ciliated and cuboidal cells.</p>\r\n<p><em>Desirable:</em> VHL.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-25T15:45:11"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 470,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Staging",
    "headingPosition": 16,
    "headingid": 383,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63468,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 213,
        "headingId": 383,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Not clinically relevant</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-25T15:45:11"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 471,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Prognosis and prediction",
    "headingPosition": 17,
    "headingid": 384,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63469,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 213,
        "headingId": 384,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>These are benign, except for a single report of peritoneal metastases in a patient without VHL {22296276}.</p>",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-25T15:45:11"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  }
]